// wwe2k14 patch (Session 66, H1.1): see VulkanCommandProcessor::FlushPendingReadbacks.
REXCVAR_DEFINE_BOOL(readback_resolve_batch, false, "GPU/Vulkan",
                    "Session 66 (H1.1): with readback mode full, a resolve's copy back into guest memory is not waited "
                    "for at once: it is queued, and one submission end + wait copies all queued ones (in order) at the "
                    "next point where the guest can see GPU-written memory (a command processor write into guest "
                    "memory, an interrupt, a swap, a read pointer write-back, any other wait, a poll of a queued "
                    "destination, the batch limit, a mode change). Exact: the guest only acts on resolve output after a "
                    "completion write the command processor itself makes. [readback][batch] logs the flushes")
    .lifecycle(rex::cvar::Lifecycle::kHotReload);
